        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b133946-PuWmDuOGkb2W.png"
        },
        "description": "Koguma is a taciturn young girl that gains friends, self-confidence, and the thrill of adventure after purchasing her Super Cub.\n\nKoguma's father died when she was young and her mother left when she entered high school. She doesn't have any other relatives and lives by herself. She also doesn't have any hobbies or any friends and is quite unnoticeable at school.",
